  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>A square-jawed fighter in a winged helmet and chain mail, outlined in ink a shade heavier than everything around him, so he always looks slightly in front of the room. He introduces himself the way the strip's title panel did: 'FRED THE FIGHTER!' His player may not remember playing him. That is the point: he may only ever have been a comic strip, and he is here anyway.</p><p><strong>Remnant.</strong> Max Hit Points, never rolled. It never attacks first. It cannot answer any question about its past that is not its Signature. It cannot leave a room by a door the party came through.</p>",
    "public": ""
   },
