    "description": {
     "value": "<p>Once per round, one of Fred's Longsword attacks hits without a roll and deals maximum damage ([[/damage 12 slashing]]), and the hit appears in the air above the target in hand-lettered capitals: <em>POW!</em>, <em>KRAK!</em>, <em>THWACK!</em> Everyone present can read it. It fades by the end of the round.</p>",
